within Pharmacolibrary.Drugs.L_AntineoplasticAndImmunomodulatingAgents.L04A_Immunosuppressants.L04AJ03_Pegcetacoplan;
model Pegcetacoplan_Crass2024_PD_ldh
  "sigmoid_emax exposure-response sweep — Crass_2024 :: LDH (lactate dehydrogenase)"
  extends Pharmacolibrary.Pharmacodynamic.SigmoidEmaxSweep(
    E0 = 3.18823501233e-21,      // [kg/m3; U/L × 1.66054e-24]
    Emax = -1.52769594341e-22,  // [kg/m3; U/L × 1.66054e-24]
    EC50 = 0.187,  // [kg/m3; μg/mL × 0.001]
    gamma = 3.42,
    exposure_per_s = 0.001);   // 1 μg/mL per second
  // imax_as_negative_emax: Imax (Q323) enters SigmoidEmaxSweep as −Emax
  annotation(experiment(StartTime = 0, StopTime = 1900, Interval = 3.8),
    Documentation(info = "<html><body><h4>Pegcetacoplan_Crass2024_PD_ldh</h4><p>The steady-state exposure-response curve of Crass RL et al., <i>Drugs in R&amp;D 24(4):563–573</i> 2024 (<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1007/s40268-024-00500-7\">doi:10.1007/s40268-024-00500-7</a>) — lactate dehydrogenase [U/L] against pegcetacoplan μg/mL — obtained by sweeping the driver instead of simulating a dose. Model family: sigmoid_emax.</p><h4>The parameters, in the paper's terms</h4><pre>  E0    =       1920 U/L      drug-free response (baseline) (Baseline concentration, Q324)
  Emax  =        -92 U/L      maximal effect term (E max , % change from baseline, Q323)
  EC50  =        187 μg/mL    exposure at half of the maximal effect term (EC50, μg/mL pegcetacoplan, Q322)
  gamma =       3.42          Hill coefficient (Hill sigmoidicity coefficient, Q325)</pre><p>The algebra is <a href=\"modelica://Pharmacolibrary.Pharmacodynamic.SigmoidEmaxSweep\">SigmoidEmaxSweep</a>; this model only supplies the numbers. The x axis is one μg/mL of pegcetacoplan per second of simulated time (exposure is in kg/m3): there is no state, no dose and no kinetics — plot <code>response</code> against <code>exposure</code> (or <code>time</code>).</p><h4>What it reproduces</h4><pre>  exposure = 0         response 3.188e-21   (drug-free)
  exposure = EC50 (187 μg/mL)  response 3.112e-21
  exposure -> infinity  response 3.035e-21</pre></body></html>", revisions = "<html><body><ul><li>11/2026 generated by pharmacolibrary-dev export.pharmacolibrary_models from Crass_2024: parameters extracted from the paper by the pharmacolibrary-dev pipeline, model built by its engineer, reviewed: curated candidate</li></ul></body></html>"));
end Pegcetacoplan_Crass2024_PD_ldh;
